      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 4.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.54,
      "end_seconds": 10.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.93,
      "end_seconds": 16.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'm here because of severe back pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.29,
      "end_seconds": 22.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.85,
      "end_seconds": 30.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I take glibenclamide, 5 milligrams, before breakfast. I'm on injecting drugs, recent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.67,
      "end_seconds": 36.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "I see, go ahead would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.53,
      "end_seconds": 41.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "about a a four out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.36,
      "end_seconds": 48.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Okay, is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.5,
      "end_seconds": 71.49,
      "duration_seconds": 16.99,
      "text": "honestly, every other day i've also had a fever, for about a month with fever, I'd say a couple of times a week actually, there's trouble passing urine as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.38,
      "end_seconds": 82.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "have you had any chest pain, recent fall or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.82,
      "end_seconds": 92.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "No chest pain, recent fall or weight loss, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.07,
      "end_seconds": 95.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.45,
      "end_seconds": 98.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.08,
      "end_seconds": 102.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.97,
      "end_seconds": 106.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.71,
      "end_seconds": 120.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.37,
      "end_seconds": 136.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.55,
      "end_seconds": 151.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.44,
      "end_seconds": 158.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes. I told my wife I'd come today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.24,
      "end_seconds": 164.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.23,
      "end_seconds": 173.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.09,
      "end_seconds": 179.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Alright, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.42,
      "end_seconds": 185.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Plasters. I come out in... well, a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.02,
      "end_seconds": 200.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.85,
      "end_seconds": 212.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.79,
      "end_seconds": 233.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 95 percent on room air, BP is 122 over 72, pulse 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.87,
      "end_seconds": 240.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.98,
      "end_seconds": 244.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.33,
      "end_seconds": 265.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "Your spine is extremely tender at one level and your leg strength is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.6,
      "end_seconds": 282.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Right, here's what I'm thinking. The most likely explanation is a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.97,
      "end_seconds": 286.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.75,
      "end_seconds": 309.18,
      "duration_seconds": 21.43,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book urgent blood tests to look into possible spinal infection. Let's get an urgent MRI of the spine, for possible epidural abscess."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.55,
      "end_seconds": 315.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.35,
      "end_seconds": 325.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "You are going to hospital now, this can cause permanent weakness. We'll refer you to the spinal team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.41,
      "end_seconds": 330.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.07,
      "end_seconds": 338.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.44,
      "end_seconds": 343.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.31,
      "end_seconds": 351.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Let's plan a check straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.07,
      "end_seconds": 356.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.09,
      "end_seconds": 359.52,
